<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico injected 5.506 billion pesos in the secondary market on Tuesday through four credit auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS    TERM     MAX    MIN   AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>1.253  bln pesos  10 days  29.76  29.50   29.76     3    3</p>
<p>1.253  bln pesos   9 days  29.77  29.66   29.70    N/A   N/A</p>
<p>2.000  bln pesos   6 days  29.55  29.46   29.50    N/A   N/A</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos   2 days  29.48  29.41   29.44    N/A   N/A</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
